# Color applet: Arizona, the palette, a custom colour (hue 40, sat 200, lum 100) added and the
# selector closed, Tab Tab Tab to OK and Space (SetSysColors: the Control Panel repaints in Arizona),
# then Settings > Exit. Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/color-ok.scn; compare in 16 colours
# (tests/color.sh) and compare OUT/ini/WIN.INI [colors], CONTROL.INI [current] and [Custom Colors]
# with arch311-ref/run-color-ok/WINDOWS.
sleep 400
shot shots/01.png
key enter
key down
key tab
key tab
key space
key tab
key tab
key tab
key space
key 4
key 0
key tab
key 2
key 0
key 0
key tab
key 1
key 0
key 0
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key space
sleep 400
shot shots/02.png
key tab
key space
sleep 400
shot shots/03.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
sleep 400
shot shots/04.png
key space
sleep 600
shot shots/05.png
key alt
key s
key x
sleep 400
quit
